      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "築二城於湖口，偽龍驤將軍陳慶領舸於前為游軍。",
      "reading": "湖口築二城，陳慶領游軍。",
      "note": "湖口築二城，陳慶領游軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 57,
      "end_codepoint": 79,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-79",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世率龍驤將軍佼長生、董凱之攻克二城，因擊慶，慶戰大敗，投水死者數千人。",
      "reading": "張興世與佼長生、董凱之戰勝陳慶。",
      "note": "張興世與佼長生、董凱之戰勝陳慶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 79,
      "end_codepoint": 115,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-115",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "時臺軍據赭圻，南賊屯鵲尾，相持久不決。",
      "reading": "在赭圻、鵲尾相持。",
      "note": "在赭圻、鵲尾相持。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 115,
      "end_codepoint": 134,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-134",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世建議曰：「賊據上流，兵強地勝。",
      "reading": "引張興世建議，記敵軍據上游。",
      "note": "引張興世建議，記敵軍據上游。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 134,
      "end_codepoint": 151,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-151",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "我今雖相持有餘，而制敵不足。",
      "reading": "先陳我軍難取勝。",
      "note": "先陳我軍難取勝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 151,
      "end_codepoint": 165,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-165",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "今若以兵數千，潛出其上，因險自固，隨宜斷截，使其首尾周遑，進退疑沮，中流一梗，糧運自艱。",
      "reading": "繼陳截糧之議。",
      "note": "繼陳截糧之議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 165,
      "end_codepoint": 209,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-209",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "制賊之奇，莫過於此。」",
      "reading": "用奇議言畢。",
      "note": "用奇議言畢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 209,
      "end_codepoint": 220,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-220",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "沈攸之、吳喜並贊其計。",
      "reading": "沈攸之與吳喜贊同。",
      "note": "沈攸之與吳喜贊同。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 220,
      "end_codepoint": 231,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-231",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "時豫州刺史殷琰據壽陽同逆，為劉勔所攻，南賊遣龐孟虯率軍助琰，劉勔遣信求援甚急。",
      "reading": "殷琰據壽陽，龐孟虯來救，劉勔請援。",
      "note": "殷琰據壽陽，龐孟虯來救，劉勔請援。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 231,
      "end_codepoint": 270,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-270",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "建安王休仁欲遣興世救之，問沈攸之。",
      "reading": "建安王休仁問沈攸之是否遣興世救。",
      "note": "建安王休仁問沈攸之是否遣興世救。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 270,
      "end_codepoint": 287,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-287",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "攸之曰：「孟虯蟻寇，必無能為。",
      "reading": "沈攸之謂孟虯勢不足憂。",
      "note": "沈攸之謂孟虯勢不足憂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 287,
      "end_codepoint": 302,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-302",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "遣別將馬步數千，足以相制。",
      "reading": "可遣別將。",
      "note": "可遣別將。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 302,
      "end_codepoint": 315,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-315",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "若有意外，且以江西餌之。",
      "reading": "繼稱有意外可應於江西。",
      "note": "繼稱有意外可應於江西。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 315,
      "end_codepoint": 327,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-327",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "上流若捷，不憂不殄。",
      "reading": "若勝上游，下游局勢可解。",
      "note": "若勝上游，下游局勢可解。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 327,
      "end_codepoint": 337,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-337",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世之行，是安危大機，必不可輟。」",
      "reading": "堅持張興世的原行軍任務。",
      "note": "堅持張興世的原行軍任務。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 337,
      "end_codepoint": 354,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence3-354",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "乃遣段佛榮等援勔。",
      "reading": "於是別遣段佛榮援劉勔。",
      "note": "於是別遣段佛榮援劉勔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 354,
      "end_codepoint": 363,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世欲率所領直取大雷，而軍旅未集，不足分張。",
      "reading": "原擬趨大雷，兵未集。",
      "note": "原擬趨大雷，兵未集。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence4-22",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "會薛索兒平定，太宗使張永以步騎五千留戍盱眙，餘眾二萬人悉遣南討。",
      "reading": "薛索兒平定後，張永留五千守盱眙，其餘南行。",
      "note": "薛索兒平定後，張永留五千守盱眙，其餘南行。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence4-54",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "山陽又尋平，徵阮佃夫所領諸軍，悉還南伐，眾軍大集。",
      "reading": "山陽平，收阮佃夫諸軍。",
      "note": "山陽平，收阮佃夫諸軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p004",
