      "end_codepoint": 397,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence4-397",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "俄而賊來轉近，舫入洄洑，興世乃命壽寂之、任農夫率壯士數百擊之，眾軍相繼進，胡於是敗走。",
      "reading": "後遣壽寂之、任農夫應戰，劉胡敗退。",
