    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-67",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "是日，劉胡果率眾軍，欲更攻興世。",
      "reading": "劉胡再欲攻興世。",
      "note": "劉胡再欲攻興世。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 67,
      "end_codepoint": 83,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-83",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "未至錢谿數十里，袁顗以濃湖之急遽追之，錢溪城柴由此得立。",
      "reading": "袁顗因濃湖緊急召人，錢谿城成。殿本連書「更攻興世未至」，數位在興世後點斷，未至一語承劉胡。",
      "note": "袁顗因濃湖緊急召人，錢谿城成。殿本連書「更攻興世未至」，數位在興世後點斷，未至一語承劉胡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 83,
      "end_codepoint": 111,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-111",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "賊連戰轉敗，興世又遏其糧道，尋陽遣運至南陵，不敢下，賊眾漸饑。",
      "reading": "張興世阻糧，尋陽轉運止於南陵。",
      "note": "張興世阻糧，尋陽轉運止於南陵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 111,
      "end_codepoint": 142,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-142",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "劉胡乃遣顗安北府司馬、偽右軍沈仲玉領千人步取南陵，迎接糧運。",
      "reading": "劉胡遣袁顗府司馬沈仲玉接糧。",
      "note": "劉胡遣袁顗府司馬沈仲玉接糧。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 142,
      "end_codepoint": 172,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-172",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "仲玉至南陵，領米三十萬斛，錢布數十舫，豎榜為城，規欲突過。",
      "reading": "沈仲玉收三十萬斛糧和數十舫錢布。",
      "note": "沈仲玉收三十萬斛糧和數十舫錢布。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 172,
      "end_codepoint": 201,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-201",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "行至貴口，不敢進，遣間信報胡，令遣重軍援接。",
      "reading": "至貴口請重兵接應。",
      "note": "至貴口請重兵接應。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 201,
      "end_codepoint": 223,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-223",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世、壽寂之、任農夫、李安民等三千人至貴口擊之，與仲玉相值。",
      "reading": "張興世、壽寂之、任農夫、李安民遇沈仲玉。",
      "note": "張興世、壽寂之、任農夫、李安民遇沈仲玉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 223,
      "end_codepoint": 253,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-253",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "交戰盡日，仲玉走還顗營，悉虜其資實，賊眾大敗，胡棄軍遁走，顗仍亦奔散。",
      "reading": "沈仲玉敗還袁顗營，劉胡、袁顗也退。",
      "note": "沈仲玉敗還袁顗營，劉胡、袁顗也退。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 253,
      "end_codepoint": 288,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-288",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世率軍追討，與吳喜共平江陵。",
      "reading": "張興世、吳喜共平江陵。",
      "note": "張興世、吳喜共平江陵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 288,
      "end_codepoint": 303,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence5-303",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "遷左軍將軍，尋為督豫司二州南豫州之梁郡諸軍事，封作唐縣侯，食邑千戶。",
      "reading": "遷左軍將軍，督軍、封作唐縣侯，邑千戶。殿本督文作豫司二州南豫州六郡，數位為梁郡。",
      "note": "遷左軍將軍，督軍、封作唐縣侯，邑千戶。殿本督文作豫司二州南豫州六郡，數位為梁郡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 303,
      "end_codepoint": 337,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "徵為游擊將軍。",
      "reading": "徵游擊將軍。",
      "note": "徵游擊將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 7,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-7",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "海道北伐，假輔國將軍，加節置佐，無功而還。",
      "reading": "假輔國將軍海道北伐，無功還。",
      "note": "假輔國將軍海道北伐，無功還。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 7,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "四年，遷太子右衞率，又以本官領驍騎將軍，與左衞將軍沈攸之參員置。",
      "reading": "泰始四年任太子右衞率，領驍騎將軍。",
      "note": "泰始四年任太子右衞率，領驍騎將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 60,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-60",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "五年，轉左衞將軍。",
      "reading": "五年轉左衞將軍。",
      "note": "五年轉左衞將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 60,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-69",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "六年，中領軍劉勔當鎮廣陵，興世權兼領軍。",
      "reading": "六年劉勔當鎮廣陵，興世權兼領軍。",
      "note": "六年劉勔當鎮廣陵，興世權兼領軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-89",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "泰豫元年，為持節、督雍梁南北秦郢州之竟陵隨二郡諸軍事、冠軍將軍、雍州刺史，尋加寧蠻校尉。",
      "reading": "泰豫元年任雍州刺史等職。",
      "note": "泰豫元年任雍州刺史等職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 89,
      "end_codepoint": 133,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-133",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "桂陽王休範反，興世遣軍赴朝廷，未發而事平，進號征虜將軍。",
      "reading": "桂陽王休範反，興世軍未發而事定，進征虜。",
      "note": "桂陽王休範反，興世軍未發而事定，進征虜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 133,
      "end_codepoint": 161,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-161",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "廢帝元徽三年，徵為通直散騎常侍、左衞將軍。",
      "reading": "元徽三年授通直散騎常侍、左衞將軍。",
      "note": "元徽三年授通直散騎常侍、左衞將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 161,
      "end_codepoint": 182,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-182",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "五年，以疾病徙光祿大夫，常侍如故。",
      "reading": "五年病轉光祿大夫，常侍如故。",
      "note": "五年病轉光祿大夫，常侍如故。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 182,
      "end_codepoint": 199,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-199",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "順帝昇明二年，卒，時年五十九。",
      "reading": "昇明二年（478）卒，原報五十九。南齊書張欣泰傳敘元徽中蒼梧王劫其財、因憂懼病卒，未繫卒年。",
      "note": "昇明二年（478）卒，原報五十九。南齊書張欣泰傳敘元徽中蒼梧王劫其財、因憂懼病卒，未繫卒年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 199,
      "end_codepoint": 214,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence6-214",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "追贈本官。",
      "reading": "本傳追贈本官。",
      "note": "本傳追贈本官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p006",
      "start_codepoint": 214,
      "end_codepoint": 219,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence7-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世居臨沔水，沔水自襄陽以下，至于九江，二千里中，先無洲嶼。",
      "reading": "居臨沔水，記襄陽下游至九江水程與洲嶼。",
      "note": "居臨沔水，記襄陽下游至九江水程與洲嶼。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p007",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 30,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:received_sentence7-30",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "ykp_uqh_6be_A",
      "source_quote": "興世初生，當其門前水中，一旦忽生洲，年年漸大，及至興世為方伯，而洲上遂十餘頃。",
      "reading": "敘其出生時忽生洲以及長成十餘頃的地方傳說。",
      "note": "敘其出生時忽生洲以及長成十餘頃的地方傳說。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-zhangxingshi-complete:p007",
